# Generated runtime evidence and pids stay out of git so the strict launcher's
# clean-tree gate keeps passing across supervisor restarts. Only the harness and
# the human-written run verdicts are tracked. A dirty tree makes every automatic
# restart fail closed.
snapshots/
manifest.json
incidents.log
*.log
*.pid
*.out
*.jsonl
*.json
# Preserved evidence from invalidated runs: keep the written verdict, ignore the raw
# artefacts it describes.
invalidated_run_*/**
!invalidated_run_*/INVALID.md

# --- Permanent evidence archive (RC1) -------------------------------------
# The validation campaign is preserved as ONE checksummed, compressed bundle so
# the evidence lives in repository history rather than only on one machine.
# 912 KB compressed from 12 MB. The expanded working copy stays ignored; the
# bundle, its digest and the archive index are tracked.
archive/*
!archive/README.md
!archive/RC1_forward_paper_validation.tar.gz
!archive/RC1_forward_paper_validation.tar.gz.sha256
# Raw audit capture directories: fully contained in the RC evidence bundle above,
# so they are not tracked separately. A clean tree is a hard precondition for the
# strict launcher's restart path.
closeout_*/
